@startuml
title A signed-in customer saves and opens a search

participant "Customer [settled]" as C #C8E6C9
participant "Shop page [settled]" as S #C8E6C9
participant "Accounts service [settled]" as A #C8E6C9

C -> S : Saves the search with a name
S -> A : Sends the name and the normalised query
A --> S : Stores it, or answers 401 or 409
C -> S : Opens a saved search from the account menu
S -> A : Asks for the saved searches of the customer
S -> S : Runs the stored query again

note over A #C8E6C9 : At most 20 saved searches for each customer
@enduml
